# Lab 08 – Bias-Variance Tradeoff

## Overview
This lab explored the bias-variance tradeoff and how model complexity affects performance.

## What I Learned
- What underfitting means
- What overfitting means
- How learning curves can show model performance
- Why a model needs to balance simplicity and complexity

## Tools Used
- Python
- scikit-learn
- matplotlib

## Reflection
This lab helped me understand why a model can perform well on training data but poorly on new data.
